      STR_GJR_MOVE_ACE: "Strafing Run"
      STR_GJR_MOVE_ACE_DESC: "Once per mission, if a Skystriker is in service, one strafing pass along a line of tiles. (Air: Ace Maneuver, dodges every shot in one dogfight round.)"
